      "question": "Use filter_lines with lines_to_remove equal to MacBook, iPad, Revenue_Billions, Watch, AirPods, Services, Other_Products to determine in which year the revenue of iPhone reached its historical peak.",
      "ground_truth": {
        "task_type": "clear_single",
        "answer": {
